<Slide style={{ width:'1280px', height:'720px', padding:'60px', background:'#FFFFFF', fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei', display:'flex', flexDirection:'column' }}>
<Box style={{ height:46, flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', justifyContent:'space-between' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'baseline', gap:18 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>设计输入与业务规则</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#5A6B61', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>第 3 章 · 32 FR / 12 NFR / 8 模块</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', gap:12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5A6B61', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>FTDMS · 总体设计报告</Text><Image src="assets/logo_icon.png" style={{ width: 36, height: 36, objectFit: 'contain' }} /></Box></Box>
<Box style={{ height:1, background:'#CFD9D2', marginTop:8, marginBottom:20 }}></Box>
<Box style={{ height:462, flexDirection:'column', gap:18 }}><Box style={{ height:150, flexDirection:'row', gap:20 }}><Box style={{ flex:1, flexDirection:'column', gap:6, alignItems:'center', justifyContent:'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 64, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.1 }}>32</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#5A6B61', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>项功能需求 FR-01～FR-32，全部 M 级</Text></Box><Box style={{ flex:1, flexDirection:'column', gap:6, alignItems:'center', justifyContent:'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 64, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.1 }}>12</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#5A6B61', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>项非功能需求，含安全、隐私与性能</Text></Box><Box style={{ flex:1, flexDirection:'column', gap:6, alignItems:'center', justifyContent:'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 64, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.1 }}>8</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#5A6B61', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>个功能模块，覆盖记录、统计与 AI</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height:294, flexDirection:'column', gap:0 }}><Box style={{ height:58, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 190 }}>营养换算</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>单项摄入 = 每 100 g 营养值 × 克重 ÷ 100；由 NutritionCalculator 纯函数实现</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:58, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 190 }}>营养快照</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>新增时计算并落库；改克重按原快照与原克重比例换算，不读最新食物库</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:58, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 190 }}>训练完成率</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>完成数 ÷（计划总数 − 取消数）；分母为 0 返回 null，显示「暂无计划」</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:58, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 190 }}>缺失与有效天数</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>未记录显示「未记录」不按 0 统计；七日平均只用有效日，跨日按 Asia/Shanghai</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:58, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 190 }}>设计输入映射</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>FR 编号 → 接口族 → Service / 数据表 → 用例组，逐条写入第 8.1 节追踪矩阵</Text></Box></Box></Box>
<Box style={{ height:50, marginTop:9, background:'#F4F8F5', flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', padding:'0 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>设计输入先定死口径，再映射到接口、表与用例；前端与模型都不参与算数。</Text></Box>
